    rdf:value """Friday, Aug. 30, 1907
Grand Hotel, Harrogate.
Spent the day getting here from Oxford by means of cross-country trains that did not connect. Ray and Karin with me.
The Robillants and Dora dined with Bernhard and Carlo. B.B. lunched with Brauer and meet Mr. and Mrs. Alfred Weismann, and then had a walk with the Serristori. He dined with the Ronalds, Mrs. Edgar and the Curtises."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 264 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1907> .

